## OptionalDeps: VoiceOverRedux, ZoneLore
# The renamed addons' tombstones. Migrate() runs on this addon's ADDON_LOADED and reads
# their saved variables, which exist only once those folders have loaded; without this
# line they sort after "SpokenPlayer" and the settings would be read too early, as empty.
## X-Part-Of: Spoken
## X-Spoken-Player: 1

